# Gabriel Bootstrap Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/bootstrap/FEATURE.md`,
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`, and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/docs/RUNTIME-OPTIMIZATION-HISTORY.md` before changing
  this area.
- Use `bootstrap/FEATURE.md` references and `session-plugins/FEATURE.md` when
  bootstrap order or plugin injection changes session wiring.
- Current optimization notes: no bootstrap-only runtime entry yet; still consult
  the optimization history when plugin injection order affects cached, delayed,
  or throttled session behavior.
- Update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/bootstrap/FEATURE.md` in the same turn whenever
  behavior, file ownership, load paths, settings, dependencies, or optimization
  assumptions change.
- When `sessionPlugins` URL list or order changes, update
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` if the overview must reflect it.
- If the change crosses into another Gabriel area, update both adjacent docs.
